      "description": "Generate a REAL marketing image via AI, save it to the existing Gallery with its visual direction, and attach it to a draft post. Pass post_id plus prompt, aspect_ratio (4:5, 1:1 or 9:16) and a structured visual_direction. Use any visual treatment that serves the message \u2014 photography, illustration, collage, typography-led composition, or other approaches. Optional: campaign_id, portfolio_item_id, text_overlay, reference_asset_urls, original_request, regenerate + variation_instruction. Returns ok, media_id, image_url, post_id, aspect_ratio and the previous version. Never approves, schedules or publishes."
